meta {
  name: Launch status
  type: http
  seq: 19
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/launch-status
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  What THIS running process actually does, per signal family: enforced / observed / simulated, derived from the connector modes behind the signals it holds - nothing configurable. A fixtures-only core reads simulated; a live connector reads observed; enforced is reported unreachable with its reason. Aggregate and anonymous (counts and modes only).
}
